  "body": "Split out of #44, which named it as owed on the way. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive/mod.rs` is at 435 lines; AGENTS.md \"Code shape\" caps source files at about 400.\n\nSplit it along a real domain seam (not an arbitrary cut), with no behaviour change: every adaptive golden stays byte-identical and the `#[test]` count before and after matches.\n\nEffort is `high` only because of the safety floor (toolpath generation code); the work itself is a mechanical move.\n\nDone means: no file under `adaptive/` is over 400 lines, the adaptive suites and goldens are unchanged, clippy is clean.\n",
